WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:11.928
-[bells chime]
-[chalk scrapes]

00:12.012 --> 00:14.305
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

00:14.389 --> 00:17.851
I checked everywhere,
and there's no CCTV covering the rooftop.

00:18.518 --> 00:21.438
I did find one at the place next door
that might have caught part of it.

00:21.521 --> 00:23.523
Can you explain while you're showing me?

00:23.606 --> 00:24.941
-Yeah.
-Of course.

00:25.025 --> 00:28.319
The footage is pretty bad though.
It's hard to make anything out.

00:29.154 --> 00:30.071
Just play it.

00:30.155 --> 00:32.574
[tense music plays]

00:32.657 --> 00:34.993
-[Geun-dae] There! You see?
-Can you zoom in?

00:35.577 --> 00:36.536
Yeah.

00:46.421 --> 00:48.048
What if someone was behind here?

00:49.966 --> 00:52.302
He could have been pushed off that roof.

01:02.187 --> 01:04.939
I STAND AGAINST THE ERPB
THAT PUSHES STUDENTS TO DEATH

01:18.661 --> 01:19.788
What are you doing here?

01:21.039 --> 01:25.126
-Isn't it busy at the Bureau right now?
-Yeah, but it's even busier in my head.

01:27.087 --> 01:29.756
I keep wondering why you chose
to come back to this school.

01:29.839 --> 01:31.966
Why you reported the bullying right away.

01:32.675 --> 01:34.260
And why you're doing this now.

01:35.804 --> 01:36.846
[music fades]

01:39.265 --> 01:40.433
How much do you know exactly?

01:42.519 --> 01:43.561
[chuckles]

01:44.729 --> 01:47.398
Oh, I'm sorry. That didn't come out right.

01:48.316 --> 01:51.694
If you really are onto something,
then I can tell you everything.

01:53.029 --> 01:55.198
You want the ERPB gone.
That much I do know.

01:55.281 --> 01:56.574
And why is that?

02:02.122 --> 02:03.456
[Hwa-jin] Because of these, I bet.

02:05.333 --> 02:06.584
[tense music plays]

02:06.668 --> 02:09.712
They're called Heart Pills.
Two years ago, they were Butterfly Pills.

02:11.047 --> 02:13.550
-What are the new ones called?
-Diamond.

02:15.301 --> 02:16.886
But you don't have any proof, do you?

02:16.970 --> 02:19.681
If you did, you'd have called the police
and had me arrested.

02:19.764 --> 02:21.975
Yet here you are, talking to me.

02:24.602 --> 02:27.188
You and Ms. Choi Ga-yun
were a match made in heaven.

02:27.689 --> 02:28.815
You're just like her.

02:30.191 --> 02:32.986
Always sticking your nose
into other people's business.

02:33.069 --> 02:35.405
I wonder if you'll end up like her too?

02:41.161 --> 02:42.996
[somber music plays]

02:46.708 --> 02:47.542
[Ga-yun] Mm!

02:48.793 --> 02:50.753
-Finally!
-[Gyu-cheol] Why are you here?

02:50.837 --> 02:53.381
-I told you I'm not going to school.
-Oh, come on.

02:53.464 --> 02:56.593
Did you really think I was just
going to say, "All right, fine, see ya?"

02:56.676 --> 02:57.760
There's no way.

02:58.261 --> 03:00.180
Hey, wait, wait. Come here.

03:00.847 --> 03:03.683
Ugh, you always get hurt somehow
when you skip school.

03:04.684 --> 03:07.270
That looks nasty.
Let me put some ointment on it.

03:07.353 --> 03:09.689
-Please, don't.
-Just stay still.

03:10.732 --> 03:11.691
Oh!

03:12.275 --> 03:13.526
Let's see the other side.

03:14.027 --> 03:18.740
Listen, I don't know what you've been
up to, but come back to school.

03:18.823 --> 03:20.408
It's the safest place for you.

03:20.909 --> 03:24.287
-Do you seriously think that's true?
-I'm not the only one.

03:24.787 --> 03:26.873
There are lots of teachers
trying to make it safe.

03:26.956 --> 03:29.542
We'll do it. I promise you. It'll be safe.

03:30.501 --> 03:32.003
Here. Pinky swear.

03:32.629 --> 03:35.590
-[gasps]
-You can break a finger doing that.

03:37.675 --> 03:41.721
You little shit. Fine, don't come.
But I'm not going anywhere, okay?

03:41.804 --> 03:43.973
I'll follow you around
for the rest of your life.

03:44.057 --> 03:46.267
Think I'm bluffing?
My boyfriend says I'm like a fly trap.

03:46.351 --> 03:49.145
Those sticky ones.
Once I catch you, I don't let go.

03:49.646 --> 03:51.731
I'll pick you up in the morning. Okay?

03:54.359 --> 03:55.360
[sighs]

03:56.152 --> 03:57.862
[Ga-yun sighs]

04:06.162 --> 04:08.414
Mm. Gyu-cheol! Good morning.

04:08.915 --> 04:11.417
No, come on. Hey. Have some.

04:11.501 --> 04:12.794
Gyu-cheol.

04:14.504 --> 04:16.506
-Hey. Come on.
-[man 1] Gyu-cheol!

04:16.589 --> 04:18.925
[Ga-yun] Why are you looking for him?
I'm his teacher.

04:19.425 --> 04:20.969
You're students, right?

04:21.052 --> 04:23.179
-Put those out.
-[man 2] What the fuck?

04:23.680 --> 04:26.307
-Gyu-cheol, come on. Let's go to school.
-[man 2] See you later.

04:26.391 --> 04:28.101
-[Ga-yun] Ignore them.
-We'll call you.

04:32.063 --> 04:34.065
[ominous music plays]

04:42.699 --> 04:44.826
[boy 1] What the hell were you thinking?

04:45.326 --> 04:48.496
You really pissed off those guys
and now they're after your ass.

04:48.579 --> 04:50.623
Is that bitch Choi Ga-yun your girlfriend?

04:51.666 --> 04:52.750
[exhales deeply]

04:52.834 --> 04:55.253
Do you know what Ms. Choi made me realize?

04:55.336 --> 04:56.504
[kids cheer]

04:56.587 --> 04:58.923
[Gyu-cheol] Schools
are packed full of people.

04:59.424 --> 05:01.259
Yeah, so? What else is new?

05:01.342 --> 05:04.637
Imagine if every single one of them
was a customer.

05:05.138 --> 05:06.848
Easy to dodge the cops.

05:06.931 --> 05:09.225
Easy to move the product back and forth.

05:09.934 --> 05:11.185
And the best part?

05:11.728 --> 05:14.564
We'd get hundreds of new customers
every single year.

05:15.773 --> 05:17.525
[boy 2] Pass it. Come on, I'm open!

05:20.028 --> 05:20.903
[sighs]

05:22.739 --> 05:24.824
-[exhales] So cold.
-[Gyu-cheol] Ms. Choi.

05:25.491 --> 05:26.534
[gasps]

05:28.745 --> 05:30.163
Gyu-cheol!

05:30.246 --> 05:31.748
You're in uniform!

05:32.832 --> 05:35.001
I figured I'd dress properly for school
from now on.

05:35.084 --> 05:37.420
Yes, that's the right attitude!

05:37.503 --> 05:39.130
Good for you! Oh!

05:40.631 --> 05:43.343
I won't touch your hair.
You've got your own style.

05:43.426 --> 05:44.927
Have you eaten anything yet?

05:45.428 --> 05:46.346
Wanna grab a bite?

06:05.990 --> 06:07.992
[dramatic music plays]

06:15.750 --> 06:17.668
I BELIEVE IN YOU, GYU-CHEOL!

06:26.511 --> 06:27.929
[Ga-yun groans]

06:28.012 --> 06:29.389
[haunting music plays]

06:34.852 --> 06:39.357
If she'd just pretended she didn't see it,
she would have been your wife by now.

06:39.941 --> 06:40.983
You know?

06:46.906 --> 06:49.826
What are you doing?
You're not planning to hit me, are you?

06:49.909 --> 06:51.369
[boy 1] Hey, the ERPB's here.

06:51.452 --> 06:53.788
[indistinct whispering]

06:54.580 --> 06:56.082
You can't do that.

06:56.165 --> 06:58.960
People are already complaining
about excessive punishment.

06:59.043 --> 07:03.131
If you hit me now, that would come across
as personal revenge.

07:06.259 --> 07:09.053
So just stay still. Don't do it.

07:09.137 --> 07:11.431
If you don't do anything,
nothing will happen to you.

07:11.514 --> 07:12.932
-[groans]
-[students gasp]

07:13.015 --> 07:14.058
[dramatic music plays]

07:14.142 --> 07:15.184
[Gyu-cheol groans]

07:18.479 --> 07:20.898
Man. I'm sorry, Inspector.

07:20.982 --> 07:22.692
-Oh my gosh.
-[Gyu-cheol] I was wrong.

07:22.775 --> 07:26.112
Honest, I'm really sorry.
Please don't hit me anymore.

07:26.195 --> 07:28.614
I'm really sorry. I apologize.

07:28.698 --> 07:29.699
[cries]

07:29.782 --> 07:31.284
It was all my fault.

07:31.367 --> 07:33.202
[cries] Please don't hit me.

07:33.286 --> 07:35.496
I'm really, really sorry.

07:35.580 --> 07:37.373
TEACH YOU A LESSON

07:37.457 --> 07:39.542
-[gasping]
-[Gyu-cheol] Honest, I'm really sorry.

07:39.625 --> 07:42.795
Just please don't hit me anymore.
I'm really sorry.

07:43.463 --> 07:45.339
This is exactly
what I was afraid would happen.

07:45.423 --> 07:49.427
Recently, Lee Chi-ho attempted suicide
over claims of excessive punishment,

07:49.510 --> 07:52.388
and now we're witnessing
Cho Gyu-cheol being assaulted.

07:52.472 --> 07:54.140
Why do you think this happened?

07:54.223 --> 07:55.975
The Bureau went to his school,

07:56.058 --> 07:58.478
and targeted him from the start.

07:59.479 --> 08:02.982
They went there
looking for any excuse to harass him.

08:03.065 --> 08:05.193
This revenge was personal for them.

08:05.776 --> 08:09.363
And in the end,
Mr. Lee Chi-ho was the victim.

08:10.656 --> 08:12.658
I will not tolerate this abuse of power.

08:12.742 --> 08:15.661
I've said before,
the ERPB is driven by personal vendettas.

08:15.745 --> 08:18.664
I will make sure it is dismantled.

08:19.832 --> 08:21.751
[reporter] With public opinion polls
now showing

08:21.834 --> 08:25.546
that 50% of the public
supports dismantling the ERPB,

08:25.630 --> 08:28.549
this has put significant pressure
on the president.

08:28.633 --> 08:31.344
He has been struggling to shake
the lame-duck status he has

08:31.427 --> 08:32.845
in the final stretch of his term.

08:32.929 --> 08:35.306
Despite strong resistance
from the opposition party,

08:35.389 --> 08:38.059
the president has so far
kept the ERPB alive.

08:38.142 --> 08:40.436
But with his approval rating
stuck in the low twenties,

08:40.520 --> 08:42.522
and the pressure he's under to boost it…

08:42.605 --> 08:44.315
I'll come and see you right now.

08:46.567 --> 08:48.110
[girl 1] It's the ERPB!

08:48.194 --> 08:49.529
[somber music plays]

08:56.619 --> 08:58.204
What's the ERPB doing here?

08:58.287 --> 09:00.331
[girl 2] The Bureau
shouldn't go to schools anymore.

09:00.915 --> 09:04.168
We're not potential criminals
or targets for your personal vendettas.

09:04.252 --> 09:06.379
I'm here to investigate Lee Chi-ho's case.

09:06.462 --> 09:09.173
The ERPB's the reason
Chi-ho ended up like that.

09:09.257 --> 09:11.259
Why should they be the ones investigating?

09:11.801 --> 09:15.221
Do you really think that you
can conduct a fair investigation now?

09:25.940 --> 09:28.276
[Gang-seok] Until the investigation
into the suicide attempt

09:28.359 --> 09:31.445
of the student from Jinwon High School
is concluded,

09:32.154 --> 09:36.117
the Educational Rights Protection Bureau
will suspend all duties.

09:37.827 --> 09:41.122
The duties of the ERPB inspectors
will also be put on hold.

09:41.914 --> 09:42.748
ACCESS DENIED

09:51.090 --> 09:53.593
DEPUTY DIRECTOR BONG GEUN-DAE
ERPB

10:23.372 --> 10:24.457
[music fades]

10:35.301 --> 10:39.221
Hey. Everything's all set.
When do we start moving it?

10:39.305 --> 10:41.807
We could start now.
The ERPB's out of the way.

10:41.891 --> 10:42.725
[chuckles]

10:42.808 --> 10:45.603
First, send each school's dealers
samples of the stuff.

10:46.604 --> 10:48.356
Tell them to drum up business with them.

10:48.439 --> 10:50.483
Once a school hits over 100 customers,

10:50.566 --> 10:54.445
that's when the real fun begins
and we start pushing hard.

10:54.528 --> 10:57.281
We're gonna need more runners.
We can't handle all this ourselves.

10:57.365 --> 10:58.532
[tense music plays]

10:58.616 --> 11:01.452
You know, schools
aren't just full of customers.

11:01.535 --> 11:03.204
They've got runners too.

11:03.829 --> 11:05.122
And they're all minors.

11:05.623 --> 11:07.583
No one suspects students.

11:08.376 --> 11:10.920
And even if they get caught,
they'll be released right away.

11:11.712 --> 11:13.089
But, best of all,

11:13.839 --> 11:15.091
they're disposable.

11:24.433 --> 11:27.353
I flip sneakers with this guy
to make some extra cash,

11:28.145 --> 11:29.730
but there are so many scams going on

11:29.814 --> 11:32.650
that people want to meet up
and check them out in person.

11:34.443 --> 11:36.654
All you have to do is just deliver them.

11:38.406 --> 11:39.281
[chuckles]

11:39.782 --> 11:40.658
Okay.

11:46.706 --> 11:47.832
[girl] Hey.

11:47.915 --> 11:49.667
[Seong-gu] Oh. Hi.

11:51.460 --> 11:53.838
SOYEON GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

11:53.921 --> 11:55.047
Looks good.

12:02.179 --> 12:03.389
Mm, it's good.

12:04.306 --> 12:05.141
Here.

12:05.891 --> 12:08.811
It was easy, right?
Feel like doing another?

12:09.687 --> 12:10.813
Is that okay?

12:10.896 --> 12:13.149
Of course. I'd really appreciate it.

12:20.072 --> 12:21.407
-[girl] Hey!
-[boy 1] Hey.

12:21.490 --> 12:23.117
-[boy 2] Hi!
-Hey, dude!

12:23.200 --> 12:24.201
You know where to go?

12:24.285 --> 12:25.369
Hey! Hey.

12:34.170 --> 12:36.797
All right. Looks good. Thank you!

12:51.061 --> 12:53.314
I've been making a killing.
It's wild, huh?

12:53.397 --> 12:56.150
[teacher] Genetic diversity,
species diversity…

12:56.233 --> 12:57.610
Oh. Look at all this!

12:58.486 --> 12:59.862
Jin-hyeok, Ju-won,

12:59.945 --> 13:01.322
focus, please!

13:01.822 --> 13:05.367
Within the same species, traits
are determined by genetic information.

13:05.451 --> 13:08.662
And what do we call the part of DNA
that stores that information?

13:09.497 --> 13:11.207
They're called genes.

13:12.124 --> 13:13.667
We're in the middle of class.

13:13.751 --> 13:17.046
What's going on with you today?
Everyone, stay focused, all right?

13:17.129 --> 13:19.048
[suspenseful music plays]

13:19.131 --> 13:20.925
-[girl 1] It looks good.
-[girl 2] Right?

13:21.008 --> 13:23.219
Hey, what is this, art class?

13:23.302 --> 13:25.262
You guys practicing your brushstrokes?

13:26.013 --> 13:29.475
You wouldn't need to use this.
You're pretty, and your face is small.

13:29.558 --> 13:30.768
[girl 2] I'm super jealous.

13:30.851 --> 13:33.479
Come on. I used to have
a round face like you.

13:34.146 --> 13:35.231
[girls chuckle]

13:35.314 --> 13:38.275
-I did. I just lost some weight.
-What did you do?

13:39.151 --> 13:40.569
Was it a diet, or…

13:41.362 --> 13:42.196
I took pills.

13:44.365 --> 13:45.324
They're hard to get.

13:45.908 --> 13:47.952
But try them. If they work, let me know.

13:48.035 --> 13:49.537
-Thanks so much!
-Are you sure?

13:49.620 --> 13:51.372
-Mm-hmm.
-[girl 2] This is awesome!

13:51.455 --> 13:55.334
[girl 3] Did my pitch. Need more samples.
Send some over.

13:56.752 --> 13:58.170
-Oh, Ms. Min--
-Seong-gu!

13:58.254 --> 14:01.423
Seong-jun has been in a motorcycle
accident. I have to go to the hospital.

14:01.507 --> 14:03.759
Tell the kids to have a study period.

14:05.177 --> 14:09.014
Seong-jun got badly hurt
in a motorcycle accident.

14:09.098 --> 14:11.016
Ms. Min's gone to see him.

14:12.977 --> 14:16.188
Holy fuck! Seong-jun's
been running deliveries non-stop.

14:16.272 --> 14:17.356
He managed to buy a bike!

14:18.023 --> 14:20.025
[boy 1] Fuck, really? Let's see.

14:20.109 --> 14:21.861
I'd love one.
Maybe I should boost my runs.

14:21.944 --> 14:23.863
-[boy 1] Get lost!
-[girl] Come on!

14:23.946 --> 14:26.073
-I'm a fucking genius, guys.
-What?

14:26.156 --> 14:28.075
Why don't we just take over
Seong-jun's route?

14:28.158 --> 14:29.577
-How, how, how, how?
-We can do it.

14:29.660 --> 14:31.662
-That's a great idea!
-[boy 2 laughs]

14:31.745 --> 14:33.581
-I can smell the cash.
-I get to go first.

14:33.664 --> 14:35.875
[teacher 1] Don't you feel like
the mood's changed here?

14:35.958 --> 14:39.587
Kids are leaving early or missing school,
and they seem to be so distracted.

14:39.670 --> 14:41.422
[teacher 2 sighs] I'm scared of them.

14:41.505 --> 14:44.300
When the Bureau was around,
we weren't getting respect or anything,

14:44.383 --> 14:46.343
but at least we felt protected in a way.

14:46.427 --> 14:48.804
[sighs] Now, it feels
like we're back to square one.

14:48.888 --> 14:50.180
[somber music plays]

14:50.264 --> 14:51.265
[teacher 1 sighs]

14:57.563 --> 14:58.981
LOOKING FOR ADHD MEDS
OK, CAN DO

15:01.483 --> 15:02.401
NEED BEAUTY PILLS

15:02.484 --> 15:04.820
-Whoa, shit man.
-[cell phone buzzes]

15:05.738 --> 15:10.117
We've got, like, 17 schools in Seoul alone
and about 100 orders from each one.

15:10.200 --> 15:12.369
Pushing those samples
paid off for us, then.

15:12.453 --> 15:13.454
[chuckles]

15:14.246 --> 15:15.122
[cell phone chimes]

15:15.623 --> 15:16.457
[Gyu-cheol sighs]

15:17.541 --> 15:19.460
Let's start really going for it today.

15:19.543 --> 15:21.921
[boy] Okay. Should I blast it
over Telegram?

15:22.004 --> 15:23.380
[suspenseful music plays]

15:23.464 --> 15:24.840
CHO GYU-CHEOL
DROP IT ONCE PAID

15:26.133 --> 15:27.384
[cell phone chimes]

15:27.468 --> 15:28.469
DROP IT ONCE PAID

15:28.552 --> 15:29.637
DROP IT ONCE PAID

15:45.986 --> 15:48.948
-Can I go and see the nurse?
-[teacher] Mm-hmm.

15:49.031 --> 15:51.450
Miss, I've got a really bad headache.

15:51.533 --> 15:55.120
Uh, Miss, can I be excused? I've got
a bad stomachache. It really hurts.

15:56.538 --> 15:57.373
Huh?

15:57.456 --> 15:58.582
[boy] Uh, Miss.

15:58.666 --> 16:00.084
My grandma's

16:00.167 --> 16:01.418
taken a bad turn.

16:01.502 --> 16:03.671
She's really ill, so I've got to get home.

16:04.213 --> 16:05.464
I'll see you tomorrow.

16:07.383 --> 16:08.467
Ah, shit.

16:13.222 --> 16:15.641
-[girl] Stop pushing!
-[laughter]

16:15.724 --> 16:17.393
-Hey, get moving.
-[laughter]

16:23.649 --> 16:24.733
[Gyu-cheol] Hey, Seong-gu.

16:25.359 --> 16:26.568
I saved one for you.

16:27.903 --> 16:29.029
There you go.

16:30.823 --> 16:32.241
[dramatic music plays]

16:53.595 --> 16:55.597
[tense music plays]

17:00.728 --> 17:04.273
[Seong-gu] Inspector Na Hwa-jin,
please call me when you get this message.

17:04.898 --> 17:07.609
I'll be at the convenience store
across the street from school.

17:15.534 --> 17:16.827
[cell phone buzzes]

17:19.329 --> 17:21.540
Hi, Seong-gu.
I'm here in front of the store.

17:22.041 --> 17:23.584
[Seong-gu] I'm sorry, Inspector.

17:24.084 --> 17:26.420
There was something urgent
I needed to do at home.

17:27.087 --> 17:28.130
I just remembered,

17:28.213 --> 17:30.549
so I went straight to my house.

17:30.632 --> 17:31.550
Oh yeah?

17:33.010 --> 17:34.344
Is everything okay?

17:34.845 --> 17:36.513
[Seong-gu] Yeah, it's all good.

17:37.598 --> 17:39.308
[tense music plays]

17:39.391 --> 17:40.350
Yes.

17:42.770 --> 17:44.021
Little fucker.

17:46.315 --> 17:49.401
Tell them to drop the product off, take
pictures, and send them to the customers.

17:50.861 --> 17:52.071
As for this guy…

17:54.281 --> 17:55.741
[Gyu-cheol sighs]

17:58.160 --> 17:59.161
He's a good kid.

18:01.371 --> 18:02.372
What a shame.

18:54.466 --> 18:55.592
[music fades]

19:01.098 --> 19:03.100
[suspenseful music plays]

19:05.561 --> 19:10.732
SOYEON GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

19:10.816 --> 19:11.650
[gasps]

19:46.977 --> 19:49.438
You must have been quite surprised.

19:51.064 --> 19:54.484
Inspector Na Hwa-jin
set up this whole operation in secret.

19:56.320 --> 19:58.947
So hitting Cho Gyu-cheol
was part of your plan?

20:01.200 --> 20:04.578
[Hwa-jin] In order for us to get evidence,
Cho Gyu-cheol needed to make a move.

20:05.078 --> 20:08.707
And for that to happen, the ERPB
had to be gone, just like he planned.

20:09.541 --> 20:10.709
[sighs]

20:10.792 --> 20:12.252
[music fades]

20:12.336 --> 20:15.923
Of course, I will take full responsibility
for my actions

20:16.423 --> 20:17.591
once this is over.

20:19.343 --> 20:21.386
I'll take responsibility as well.

20:21.470 --> 20:24.973
My father runs a small gym
and I can always work there, no sweat.

20:31.605 --> 20:33.732
Uh, so, Minister,

20:34.358 --> 20:39.238
you've done so much hard work here
at the Bureau over the past two years.

20:39.321 --> 20:40.822
-Save it.
-[Geun-dae] It's been--

20:42.115 --> 20:44.243
-I'll take responsibility.
-No, you won't.

20:45.327 --> 20:47.621
We all know what a great team you are.

20:48.121 --> 20:49.122
[exhales]

20:50.207 --> 20:51.166
[rock music plays]

20:51.250 --> 20:53.418
I'll be the one to take responsibility.

20:53.502 --> 20:54.836
You all just stick

20:55.545 --> 20:56.922
to the original plan.

21:01.134 --> 21:02.135
Goodbye, sir.

21:05.472 --> 21:06.348
Oh.

21:06.431 --> 21:09.893
So, should we
look into getting backup first?

21:09.977 --> 21:13.355
Like, ask the police to help us,
or something?

21:13.438 --> 21:16.275
The police would be a long shot
without hard evidence.

21:16.358 --> 21:20.237
Besides, they'd be really reluctant
to go into the school. [winces]

21:20.320 --> 21:23.115
All right, then,
we'll, just make it work, that's all.

21:23.198 --> 21:25.659
The three of us can manage.
We'll work around the clock.

21:26.368 --> 21:27.536
Im Han-rim,

21:29.204 --> 21:31.331
what makes you think
it's just the three of us?

21:32.791 --> 21:33.750
[music stops]

21:37.337 --> 21:40.799
This is Choi Gang-seok of the ERPB.

21:41.300 --> 21:42.384
I know,

21:43.427 --> 21:45.262
a lot better than anyone,

21:45.345 --> 21:47.431
just how hard you all work.

21:47.931 --> 21:50.809
Every single day,
you care for your students.

21:50.892 --> 21:53.103
You're standing in for their parents.

21:53.186 --> 21:57.024
That's why it's hard for me to have
to share this difficult news with you.

21:57.524 --> 21:58.859
Unfortunately,

21:58.942 --> 22:02.029
we have confirmed
that there is a new type of drug

22:02.946 --> 22:06.283
being distributed among middle
and high school students

22:06.366 --> 22:08.035
in Seoul presently.

22:08.952 --> 22:11.371
If this drug starts circulating,

22:12.289 --> 22:13.665
then schools

22:14.291 --> 22:17.085
will all suffer irreversible damage.

22:17.669 --> 22:22.382
It will be the students
who will end up paying the ultimate price.

22:23.008 --> 22:26.720
I am therefore asking the teachers
who are watching this video,

22:27.512 --> 22:30.515
for the sake of our children,
please cooperate

22:31.516 --> 22:34.019
and work with the ERPB one more time.

22:34.102 --> 22:36.146
["Fade Into Forever" plays]

22:36.229 --> 22:37.272
We know

22:37.856 --> 22:40.067
you have sacrificed so much.

22:41.401 --> 22:44.363
For that, I am sorry, and ashamed.

22:44.446 --> 22:45.822
I WILL NOT FORGET
YOUR KINDNESS

22:45.906 --> 22:47.449
SAVE CLASSROOMS
SAVE TEACHERS

22:47.532 --> 22:50.327
SCHOOL IS STILL A STRUGGLE

22:50.410 --> 22:51.286
MS. CHOI!
I MISS YOU

22:51.370 --> 22:52.871
I MISS YOUR SMILE SO MUCH

22:52.954 --> 22:54.873
♪ Forever ♪

22:55.374 --> 22:58.752
♪ But I don't feel alone ♪

23:01.296 --> 23:04.800
♪ This is the place I've always known… ♪

23:04.883 --> 23:07.094
YOUR WISHES WILL NOT BE FORGOTTEN

23:07.177 --> 23:08.762
WE WILL HONOR THEM

23:09.471 --> 23:11.098
[Ms. Jung] I agree with the ERPB

23:11.181 --> 23:14.226
that schools must be
safe places for our children.

23:14.893 --> 23:17.687
I'm willing to help them out
any way I can.

23:17.771 --> 23:19.898
♪ Into forever ♪

23:20.607 --> 23:21.733
Here you go.

23:22.567 --> 23:23.860
By the way,

23:24.361 --> 23:26.029
did you hear from any other teachers?

23:27.572 --> 23:30.367
-No one else has reached out yet.
-Ah.

23:30.450 --> 23:32.202
[gentle music plays]

23:36.206 --> 23:37.374
[door opens]

23:39.334 --> 23:40.961
[footsteps approach]

23:51.972 --> 23:54.141
[uplifting music plays]

24:04.443 --> 24:07.654
These pills were all collected by us
at our schools.

24:08.155 --> 24:09.072
[music fades]

24:11.366 --> 24:13.160
[Gang-seok] I know
it couldn't have been easy.

24:14.161 --> 24:15.120
Thank you for this.

24:18.415 --> 24:20.917
But what happens if

24:21.543 --> 24:23.545
this drug is already in circulation?

24:23.628 --> 24:25.005
Don't you worry about that.

24:25.505 --> 24:26.798
It will never happen.

24:28.383 --> 24:29.217
Right?

24:30.343 --> 24:31.219
Right.

24:31.803 --> 24:34.055
♪ Listen, and learn
And listen, and learn ♪

24:34.139 --> 24:35.223
♪ And listen, and learn ♪

24:35.307 --> 24:37.184
-He's out, he's out.
-Oh, there he is.

24:37.267 --> 24:39.186
♪ And learn, and listen, and learn ♪

24:39.269 --> 24:41.897
♪ And listen, and learn, r-r-r-repeat ♪

24:41.980 --> 24:44.399
♪ Listen, and learn
And listen, and learn ♪

24:44.483 --> 24:45.484
♪ And listen, and learn… ♪

24:45.567 --> 24:46.443
-God.
-[Han-rim groans]

24:47.694 --> 24:49.237
All right. See ya later.

24:49.905 --> 24:50.947
Oh, wait, hold on.

24:51.031 --> 24:51.865
Uh…

24:52.657 --> 24:53.700
Here it is.

24:53.783 --> 24:54.701
Come here.

24:55.202 --> 24:56.536
♪ Listen, and learn… ♪

24:58.288 --> 24:59.122
Mm.

25:00.332 --> 25:01.583
-Okay?
-Beautiful.

25:01.666 --> 25:02.667
[Han-rim] Bye!

25:02.751 --> 25:06.505
These vitamins are so cool. They help you
lose weight and they're nutritional.

25:06.588 --> 25:08.965
-Does it mean we'll look like Yu-ri?
-[girl 1] I sure hope so.

25:09.049 --> 25:10.342
[girl 2] I wanna lose ten pounds.

25:10.425 --> 25:12.093
-[Han-rim] There.
-[Geun-dae] I see them.

25:12.177 --> 25:13.053
[Han-rim] Get ready.

25:13.136 --> 25:14.471
Whoa. Wh… what do I do?

25:14.554 --> 25:16.723
When they come out here,
hit me in the head.

25:17.224 --> 25:18.808
-A slap?
-No. Like in the face?

25:18.892 --> 25:20.268
[Geun-dae groans]

25:20.769 --> 25:22.354
Wait. Not in the head!

25:22.437 --> 25:23.939
[groans]

25:24.022 --> 25:25.774
-I'm sorry!
-[Han-rim] You little shit!

25:27.526 --> 25:30.445
-Hey. Where do you think you're going?
-[groans] Run! Get outta here!

25:31.947 --> 25:33.406
If you don't have any money…

25:33.490 --> 25:34.491
[Geun-dae groans]

25:34.574 --> 25:36.868
…then give me something valuable,
like your phone.

25:36.952 --> 25:38.745
-[Geun-dae] Okay!
-Your watch!

25:38.828 --> 25:42.082
-[Geun-dae coughs]
-Or vitamin C, asshole.

25:42.165 --> 25:43.750
[Geun-dae] Yeah, okay, I've got some.

25:43.833 --> 25:45.460
-Yeah?
-I've got some in here.

25:45.544 --> 25:46.586
[Han-rim] Vitamin C?

25:47.087 --> 25:49.464
-Yeah. Here, take it.
-Hey, look. Take ours.

25:49.548 --> 25:50.590
[girl] This is all we have.

25:51.341 --> 25:54.177
I'll follow the student in front
over there.

25:54.678 --> 25:56.721
I'll take the one with the brown backpack.

25:57.472 --> 25:58.515
What about the rest?

25:58.598 --> 25:59.599
Don't worry about them.

25:59.683 --> 26:01.059
I called in backup.

26:01.142 --> 26:04.938
Some kids that used to
know how to shake people down.

26:05.021 --> 26:06.231
Huh?

26:06.314 --> 26:08.817
♪ And listen, and learn,
And listen, and learn ♪

26:08.900 --> 26:11.027
♪ And listen, and learn, and listen… ♪

26:11.987 --> 26:14.114
We've collected
all the sample drugs, okay?

26:14.197 --> 26:15.824
Now moving on to the next step.

26:15.907 --> 26:18.785
[Geun-dae] I'll message them on Telegram
and place the order.

26:18.868 --> 26:20.453
♪ And listen, and learn ♪

26:20.537 --> 26:22.872
♪ And listen, and learn
And listen, and learn ♪

26:22.956 --> 26:23.873
[Han-rim] Wow!

26:23.957 --> 26:25.208
[computer chimes]

26:25.292 --> 26:26.167
[music fades]

26:28.128 --> 26:30.880
This is a new drug
that's been circulating among students.

26:30.964 --> 26:32.382
It's a substitute for the Heart Pill

26:32.465 --> 26:35.468
that was recently classified
as a controlled substance.

26:36.219 --> 26:39.389
These were discovered on school grounds
by teachers at various schools

26:39.472 --> 26:41.808
and brought to
the Educational Rights Protection Bureau.

26:41.891 --> 26:43.852
After tracing the distribution route,

26:44.352 --> 26:47.522
we have now identified the main dealer

26:48.398 --> 26:50.650
as Cho Gyu-cheol of Jinwon High School.

26:51.610 --> 26:53.361
So, as of this moment,

26:54.404 --> 26:56.573
the suspension of the Bureau's duties
has been lifted.

26:56.656 --> 26:59.200
-All inspectors will be returning to work.
-Shit.

26:59.284 --> 27:00.285
Damn it.

27:00.368 --> 27:01.578
[rock music plays]

27:02.203 --> 27:04.247
♪ I'm gonna hunt you down… ♪

27:05.790 --> 27:07.751
-Hey, can you do this?
-Yeah, hold on.

27:07.834 --> 27:09.044
♪ I'mma take your crown… ♪

27:09.127 --> 27:10.003
Thanks.

27:10.879 --> 27:12.839
[Gang-seok] We have now
identified the main dealer

27:12.922 --> 27:15.175
as Cho Gyu-cheol of Jinwon High School.

27:15.258 --> 27:16.801
[boy] Look, it's the ERPB.

27:18.386 --> 27:21.014
-♪ I'm gonna hunt you down ♪
-♪ Gonna hunt you down ♪

27:21.097 --> 27:23.683
-♪ Yeah, I ain't playing around ♪
-♪ Ain't playing around ♪

27:23.767 --> 27:25.352
♪ I'mma take your crown ♪

27:25.435 --> 27:28.229
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down ♪

27:28.313 --> 27:30.982
♪ Yeah, I be coming for you
Like Hannibal ♪

27:31.066 --> 27:32.275
-[music stops]
-[Geun-dae] Whoa!

27:32.359 --> 27:34.444
Oh. [strains]

27:38.323 --> 27:40.533
[sighs] Give it to me. I'll do it.

27:40.617 --> 27:42.702
[Geun-dae] Whoa! Hey, be careful.

27:45.830 --> 27:47.832
[suspenseful music plays]

28:21.491 --> 28:24.411
Oh! Inspector Im, this one won't open.

28:38.174 --> 28:39.175
Don't open it!

28:41.553 --> 28:42.387
[gasps] Oh!

28:46.641 --> 28:48.727
[Hwa-jin] Hold your breath! Don't inhale!

28:48.810 --> 28:51.146
[dramatic music plays]

28:51.229 --> 28:52.230
Are you okay?

28:55.483 --> 28:56.568
[Han-rim exhales]

28:57.652 --> 29:00.113
[coughs]

29:00.780 --> 29:01.614
[coughs]

29:01.698 --> 29:03.700
[tense music plays]

29:06.536 --> 29:09.164
[boy 1] Hey, guys.
Looks like they fell for the trap.

29:09.706 --> 29:11.875
[boy 2] Did you get a taste?
Fucking sweet, huh?

29:11.958 --> 29:13.084
Let me know if you want more!

29:13.168 --> 29:14.669
-[boy 1] Hey!
-[boy 2] Fucking asshole!

29:14.753 --> 29:16.755
-That idiot will never get us.
-Jackass.

29:16.838 --> 29:18.006
[Han-rim] I'll catch them.

29:18.089 --> 29:19.924
[boy 2] Come on.
Let's get the fuck out of here.

29:20.008 --> 29:22.010
[dramatic music plays]

29:22.677 --> 29:24.095
Hey, guess what?

29:26.222 --> 29:27.682
I can fly!

29:28.683 --> 29:29.684
What?

29:30.226 --> 29:32.812
Im Han-rim, preparing final descent.

29:34.981 --> 29:36.191
-Yeah!
-Oh!

29:36.274 --> 29:39.194
-[Han-rim screams]
-Whoa!

29:39.277 --> 29:41.654
-[Han-rim laughs]
-[boys groan]

29:42.363 --> 29:44.115
-[boy 2] Shit!
-[boy 1] Goddamn it

29:44.199 --> 29:46.075
-[boy 2 winces]
-[boy 1] Ow, my head.

29:46.159 --> 29:47.619
[boy 2 groans]

29:48.203 --> 29:49.204
[boy 2] Holy shit.

29:49.788 --> 29:51.331
-[boy 2 groans]
-[boy 1] Oh, fuck.

29:51.915 --> 29:54.167
-[running footsteps approach]
-[groaning]

29:54.918 --> 29:57.003
[boy 2] Ow, my back. [groans]

29:59.964 --> 30:01.633
Im Han-rim, you okay?

30:02.133 --> 30:02.967
[boy 2 groans]

30:04.219 --> 30:05.053
[Hwa-jin] Han-rim?

30:05.136 --> 30:06.387
[music fades]

30:06.471 --> 30:08.306
Don't worry about me, sir. Keep going.

30:09.098 --> 30:09.933
Huh.

30:10.767 --> 30:13.603
[imitates trumpet fanfare]

30:14.103 --> 30:18.900
[imitates trumpet]

30:18.983 --> 30:20.318
Shit.

30:20.401 --> 30:22.320
[imitates trumpet]

30:22.403 --> 30:24.697
I'll take care of Inspector Im, sir.
You go ahead.

30:24.781 --> 30:25.990
Go on, go on, hurry.

30:26.866 --> 30:29.118
-[boy 1] Holy shit.
-Okay, yeah.

30:29.202 --> 30:32.539
-[boy 2] Fuck, I thought I was gonna die.
-[boy 1] This bitch is fucking nuts.

30:32.622 --> 30:35.041
[imitates trumpet]

30:35.124 --> 30:37.126
-Oh shit.
-I can be an angel.

30:37.627 --> 30:39.170
Or I can be a devil, you know?

30:39.254 --> 30:42.173
It all depends on how I feel at the time.

30:43.049 --> 30:44.259
I'm going to be

30:45.051 --> 30:46.386
a devil now.

30:46.469 --> 30:48.012
[rock music plays]

30:49.305 --> 30:50.557
-[boy 2] Oh fuck.
-Ha!

30:50.640 --> 30:51.516
[boy 1 gasps]

30:55.061 --> 30:56.771
-[boy 1] It's a real knife!
-[boy 2] Go!

30:57.480 --> 30:58.565
[boy 1] Oh fuck!

31:03.069 --> 31:03.945
[music stops]

31:05.113 --> 31:06.781
You boneheads!

31:06.865 --> 31:08.116
[Han-rim grunts]

31:08.658 --> 31:10.118
-[boy 1] Wow.
-Move!

31:10.201 --> 31:11.536
[boy 2] She must be high.

31:11.619 --> 31:12.453
[boys laugh]

31:12.537 --> 31:14.664
-[boy 2] She's totally out of it!
-[boy 1] Shit!

31:14.747 --> 31:16.249
Come on. Try and hit me.

31:16.332 --> 31:17.333
[boy 2 laughs]

31:17.417 --> 31:19.043
[boy 1] Take that, you little… [grunts]

31:19.127 --> 31:21.796
[boy 2] You fucking little bitch.

31:21.880 --> 31:25.508
-So, you're a fucking angel now?
-[Geun-dae] Leave her alone!

31:25.592 --> 31:26.759
[Han-rim] It hurts!

31:26.843 --> 31:28.845
[intriguing music plays]

31:34.225 --> 31:36.019
You goddamn piece of shit!

31:39.731 --> 31:42.275
-Oh!
-[boy 2] Think you can beat us, asshole?

31:42.901 --> 31:43.902
[boy 1] Stupid prick!

31:47.488 --> 31:48.489
Fucking pig!

31:51.117 --> 31:52.035
[Geun-dae yells]

31:56.331 --> 31:57.165
Oh!

31:59.417 --> 32:01.377
Inspector Im! Are you okay?

32:01.461 --> 32:02.378
[sighs]

32:02.462 --> 32:04.464
Are… are you hurt at all?

32:04.547 --> 32:05.465
[music stops]

32:06.341 --> 32:08.217
So damn cute.

32:09.886 --> 32:11.220
-What?
-[Han-rim sighs]

32:11.304 --> 32:12.138
Oh!

32:13.306 --> 32:14.933
[tense music plays]

32:24.609 --> 32:27.946
-[boy 3] Hey!
-[boy 4] Where d'you think you're going?

32:29.697 --> 32:31.699
-Hey, you! Asshole.
-Me?

32:33.368 --> 32:36.871
Look, let's make this quick, all right?
I'll hit each of you one time. That's it.

32:49.759 --> 32:50.677
[boy 5] Fuck!

32:53.012 --> 32:53.888
Fucker!

33:09.237 --> 33:10.905
[boys groan]

33:12.949 --> 33:14.158
[groans]

33:16.369 --> 33:19.288
Do you know how dangerous this thing is,
you little shit?

33:20.289 --> 33:21.165
[music fades]

33:21.749 --> 33:23.793
-[Geun-dae] Why don't we sit down?
-[Han-rim] Sorry.

33:23.876 --> 33:24.711
-Sorry.
-You're good.

33:24.794 --> 33:25.920
-I'm good.
-You got it.

33:26.004 --> 33:28.297
-I can do it. Keep going.
-[Geun-dae] Whoa! Sit here.

33:28.381 --> 33:30.550
Whoa, watch it. Easy now.

33:31.217 --> 33:34.429
-[sighs]
-Are you feeling dizzy? Are you?

33:34.929 --> 33:37.181
-[sighs]
-Whoa, whoa. What should I do?

33:37.932 --> 33:39.726
[tense music plays]

33:57.577 --> 33:59.370
Well, shit, man.

34:01.039 --> 34:02.331
It's just like last time.

34:26.314 --> 34:28.107
[breathes shakily]

34:28.691 --> 34:30.068
What are you doing with this?

34:31.819 --> 34:33.738
Why didn't you call the police on me?

34:33.821 --> 34:37.408
I really wanted
to give you another chance,

34:37.492 --> 34:38.618
but you must

34:39.994 --> 34:41.412
turn yourself in.

34:46.250 --> 34:48.669
So, you haven't told anyone about it yet?

34:50.505 --> 34:52.381
This chance that you've given me,

34:53.549 --> 34:54.717
I'll make the best of it.

34:57.386 --> 34:58.805
Gyu-cheol. [gasps]

35:02.266 --> 35:04.936
You really don't fucking know
anything about me, do you?

35:05.436 --> 35:06.354
[gasps]

35:06.437 --> 35:09.107
[Gyu-cheol] Why would I turn myself in?
I'm a minor.

35:09.190 --> 35:10.650
I'll be out in no time.

35:11.150 --> 35:13.319
If they charge me with manslaughter,

35:13.402 --> 35:15.404
I'll only get two years, maximum.

35:15.488 --> 35:17.115
I come from a broken home.

35:17.198 --> 35:18.658
I had no motive at all.

35:18.741 --> 35:20.284
And to top it all off…

35:22.912 --> 35:25.164
I was in love with you this whole time.

35:25.748 --> 35:26.999
Gyu-cheol, you don't--

35:27.083 --> 35:28.835
-[knife slices]
-[Ga-yun gasps]

35:28.918 --> 35:30.169
-[flesh squelches]
-[groans]

35:31.045 --> 35:31.879
[Ga-yun groans]

35:32.588 --> 35:33.714
[Ga-yun gasps]

35:42.348 --> 35:44.684
I can always come back
and just sell this in two years.

35:44.767 --> 35:45.768
[Ga-yun breathes shakily]

35:45.852 --> 35:49.814
Thanks to you, I came back to school
and realized this is the hottest market.

35:50.982 --> 35:52.191
Too bad, though.

35:54.026 --> 35:55.653
Guess you won't be getting married now.

35:56.821 --> 35:58.364
You can't do that. [gasps]

35:58.948 --> 36:00.283
[Ga-yun breathes shakily]

36:01.325 --> 36:03.161
[groans]

36:26.684 --> 36:29.312
Guess I'm no match for an ERPB inspector.

36:30.730 --> 36:31.689
[sighs]

36:32.732 --> 36:34.150
I'm sorry about everything.

36:35.776 --> 36:36.611
Yeah.

36:37.778 --> 36:39.322
I'll hit you once then,

36:39.822 --> 36:41.282
but it is going to hurt.

36:41.365 --> 36:42.658
I wouldn't move if I were you,

36:42.742 --> 36:45.578
or another innocent person
might end up dying at this school.

36:46.704 --> 36:50.166
-[Seong-gu] No, don't!
-[boy 6] Get moving, you fucking asshole!

36:50.249 --> 36:51.334
[Seong-gu whimpers]

36:52.418 --> 36:53.878
[Seong-gu breathes shakily]

36:55.463 --> 36:56.505
[Seong-gu gasps] No!

36:56.589 --> 36:58.257
[Seong-gu sobs]

36:58.758 --> 37:01.093
[dramatic music plays]

37:01.177 --> 37:02.428
Inspector Na!

37:02.511 --> 37:04.388
[breathes shakily]

37:04.472 --> 37:06.515
-[grunts]
-What are you doing? Hold on!

37:06.599 --> 37:08.142
Whoa, are you okay?

37:09.185 --> 37:10.102
[groans]

37:10.186 --> 37:11.020
[Geun-dae] What?

37:11.103 --> 37:12.813
[shrieks]

37:13.439 --> 37:16.776
[Seong-gu whimpers]

37:17.276 --> 37:18.319
[tense music plays]

37:18.402 --> 37:19.695
I'll let Seong-gu live

37:21.447 --> 37:23.366
when you go see your beloved fiancée.

37:24.742 --> 37:25.952
Please tell her that

37:26.869 --> 37:27.870
I'm really sorry.

37:33.167 --> 37:34.877
[Gyu-cheol breathes heavily]

37:36.921 --> 37:38.005
[Gyu-cheol grunts]

37:39.715 --> 37:40.549
[Seong-gu sobs]

37:40.633 --> 37:43.094
[screams]

37:43.177 --> 37:44.679
[dramatic music plays]

37:45.263 --> 37:46.097
[boy 6] Hey.

37:46.973 --> 37:48.099
Look at him.

37:48.182 --> 37:49.433
[Seong-gu sobs]

38:01.070 --> 38:02.113
[Hwa-jin sighs]

38:07.535 --> 38:09.370
-[knife slides]
-[Gyu-cheol breathes heavily]

38:09.453 --> 38:10.830
[tense music plays]

38:10.913 --> 38:12.790
[Gyu-cheol breathes heavily]

38:12.873 --> 38:14.417
-[knife slices]
-[Seong-gu] Stop!

38:14.500 --> 38:16.502
Please, stop it!

38:16.585 --> 38:17.628
[Gyu-cheol grunts]

38:19.005 --> 38:19.839
[knife slices]

38:19.922 --> 38:21.132
[dramatic music plays]

38:24.218 --> 38:25.303
[Geun-dae] Oh my God!

38:25.386 --> 38:27.555
[screams]

38:27.638 --> 38:28.681
[breathes shakily]

38:28.764 --> 38:30.141
[Han-rim screams]

38:30.224 --> 38:32.101
I need to sober up. Help me sober up.

38:32.184 --> 38:33.394
-[Geun-dae] What?
-Do something!

38:33.477 --> 38:34.645
[Han-rim screams]

38:36.272 --> 38:38.065
[Gyu-cheol] This isn't gonna fly in court

38:39.734 --> 38:40.943
as self-defense,

38:41.444 --> 38:42.403
or as manslaughter.

38:44.030 --> 38:45.531
I'll have to move out of the country.

38:46.657 --> 38:47.575
Huh?

38:47.658 --> 38:49.744
There are schools all over the world.

38:49.827 --> 38:51.412
[groans]

38:51.495 --> 38:54.373
[classical music plays]

39:00.796 --> 39:01.839
[music stops]

39:09.805 --> 39:11.599
-[boy 6 groans]
-[knife clatters]

39:11.682 --> 39:13.476
[boy 6] Ah, fuck!

39:13.559 --> 39:14.560
[Seong-gu whimpers]

39:14.643 --> 39:15.519
[boy 6] You shit!

39:15.603 --> 39:16.437
[boy 6 yells]

39:17.980 --> 39:19.899
-Who the fuck are you?
-[Han-rim] Who am I?

39:19.982 --> 39:22.151
Inspector Im Han-rim of the ERPB.

39:27.406 --> 39:29.575
Agh, you fucking bitch! [groans]

39:30.618 --> 39:32.495
[rock music plays]

39:33.954 --> 39:34.914
[Gyu-cheol] Let go.

39:35.539 --> 39:37.249
I said let go, you fucking--

39:37.333 --> 39:38.667
[exhales]

39:39.251 --> 39:41.462
-[strains]
-You like running your mouth off.

39:41.545 --> 39:42.505
Hm?

39:43.089 --> 39:44.548
Gonna let me talk now?

39:50.012 --> 39:51.013
[exhales]

39:51.680 --> 39:52.515
[groans]

39:54.266 --> 39:55.226
[Hwa-jin exhales]

39:59.230 --> 40:01.565
[groans]

40:02.274 --> 40:03.442
Oh!

40:08.197 --> 40:09.031
Go ahead.

40:09.115 --> 40:11.909
♪ You say we are small
So you think we are weak ♪

40:11.992 --> 40:14.870
♪ Well, you might be right
But we are ready to fight… ♪

40:15.871 --> 40:16.914
Agh!

40:17.415 --> 40:18.332
[groans]

40:19.041 --> 40:21.127
That was a bad choice. Hm?

40:21.752 --> 40:23.587
You just blew another chance.

40:23.671 --> 40:25.756
♪ Chihuahua, chihuahua ♪

40:25.840 --> 40:26.799
[knife clatters]

40:26.882 --> 40:28.843
♪Chihuahua, chihuahua… ♪

40:29.427 --> 40:30.344
[Gyu-cheol groans]

40:31.178 --> 40:32.555
[Hwa-jin] Listen to me carefully.

40:32.638 --> 40:35.141
Everyone in this country
has the right to an equal education

40:35.224 --> 40:36.517
to the extent of their abilities,

40:37.601 --> 40:38.936
and through that,

40:39.437 --> 40:41.147
the right to be happy!

40:43.858 --> 40:45.151
That is what

40:45.651 --> 40:47.528
kids come to school for.

40:49.864 --> 40:50.698
Now,

40:51.282 --> 40:53.617
any bastard that gets in the way of that…

41:01.250 --> 41:02.543
no matter who,

41:04.420 --> 41:06.547
has to be taught a lesson.

41:06.630 --> 41:07.465
[grunts]

41:08.466 --> 41:10.259
[groans]

41:12.344 --> 41:13.304
[music fades]

41:13.387 --> 41:15.097
[Gyu-cheol whimpers]

41:21.729 --> 41:22.730
I'm sorry.

41:23.981 --> 41:25.191
Please don't kill me.

41:25.274 --> 41:27.860
-I have no intention of doing that.
-[Gyu-cheol] I'm really sorry.

41:28.777 --> 41:30.112
Please give me another chance.

41:31.155 --> 41:33.657
Chances aren't something you're given.

41:35.075 --> 41:37.453
You earn them when you truly want them.

41:41.874 --> 41:43.125
[Ga-yun] I wanted

41:43.626 --> 41:45.503
to give you a chance.

41:45.586 --> 41:47.004
[poignant music plays]

41:47.630 --> 41:49.131
You know, Gyu-cheol,

41:50.508 --> 41:52.009
the thing is,

41:53.511 --> 41:55.721
chances aren't something you're given.

41:57.765 --> 42:00.809
You earn them when you truly want them.

42:01.727 --> 42:02.937
-[knife slices]
-[Ga-yun gasps]

42:05.898 --> 42:06.899
[Gyu-cheol] Wow.

42:08.567 --> 42:10.694
You two were really made for each other.

42:10.778 --> 42:12.488
[haunting music plays]

42:12.571 --> 42:13.405
[Gyu-cheol chuckles]

42:14.323 --> 42:16.825
Do you know what Choi Ga-yun said
before she died?

42:19.245 --> 42:20.204
"Gyu-cheol,

42:21.121 --> 42:22.498
you can't do that."

42:24.166 --> 42:25.042
[groans]

42:26.919 --> 42:29.505
What the fuck did she mean, I can't?

42:30.673 --> 42:32.049
Don't give me that!

42:33.300 --> 42:34.969
You don't fucking care about me.

42:36.345 --> 42:39.056
I don't need a stupid chance.
Just kill me, all right?

42:40.224 --> 42:41.183
Go on.

42:41.267 --> 42:42.101
Do it!

42:42.601 --> 42:43.561
[strains]

42:43.644 --> 42:45.062
I said do it now!

42:45.145 --> 42:47.439
[Gyu-cheol breathes shakily]

42:56.949 --> 42:58.617
[Hwa-jin breathes shakily]

42:59.535 --> 43:01.412
[breathes shakily]

43:06.375 --> 43:07.209
[exhales]

43:07.835 --> 43:10.129
[breathes shakily]

43:18.220 --> 43:19.179
Gyu-cheol,

43:19.847 --> 43:21.140
I can't do that.

43:21.849 --> 43:22.808
It's okay.

43:23.350 --> 43:24.351
[Gyu-cheol cries]

43:26.478 --> 43:27.855
Let's start over, then.

43:28.355 --> 43:29.189
Mm-hmm.

43:29.273 --> 43:33.444
[Gyu-cheol cries]

43:41.327 --> 43:45.247
[sobs]

43:46.498 --> 43:49.835
This is the last chance
Ms. Choi Ga-yun will ever give you.

43:50.919 --> 43:52.921
[sobs]

43:59.887 --> 44:01.889
[poignant music plays]

44:05.351 --> 44:07.436
Oh fuck!

44:09.688 --> 44:12.191
Who the hell do you people think you are?

44:12.983 --> 44:14.735
You think you're Jesus Christ?

44:15.235 --> 44:17.821
Fucking Buddha or some shit?

44:18.322 --> 44:19.239
[Hwa-jin grunts]

44:19.323 --> 44:21.158
[Gyu-cheol sobs]

44:21.700 --> 44:24.036
[breathes shakily]

44:27.915 --> 44:29.792
We're adults, punk. That's all.

44:37.966 --> 44:39.718
[Gyu-cheol cries]

44:44.682 --> 44:45.516
[exhales]

44:48.060 --> 44:49.395
I did well, right?

45:09.748 --> 45:11.625
[inaudible]

45:29.643 --> 45:31.520
[cries]

45:34.898 --> 45:36.066
[cries]

45:38.068 --> 45:41.280
[sobs]

45:41.363 --> 45:42.573
[exhales]

45:45.409 --> 45:46.410
[music fades]

45:46.493 --> 45:47.578
[footsteps approach]

45:47.661 --> 45:49.371
[panting]

45:49.455 --> 45:51.457
[uplifting music plays]

46:03.177 --> 46:04.636
Should I get you a stapler?

46:06.096 --> 46:07.973
[laughs]

46:08.056 --> 46:09.224
Ah, shit.

46:09.975 --> 46:11.560
Don't make me laugh. [chuckles]

46:24.823 --> 46:27.785
♪ Simple as us… ♪

46:28.577 --> 46:29.995
[boy 1] Watch it, all right?

46:30.078 --> 46:32.331
-[boy 2] Stop fucking pushing!
-[officer 1] Stop resisting.

46:32.414 --> 46:34.833
[Geun-dae] You're gonna be fine. [sighs]

46:34.917 --> 46:36.126
[officer 2] Keep walking.

46:36.210 --> 46:38.337
-[boy 3] Let go of me!
-[boy 1] I get it!

46:39.087 --> 46:40.881
-[officer 1] Get in.
-[boy 3] Ow, fuck.

46:48.597 --> 46:52.643
You're being charged
with violations against the ERPB Act,

46:53.435 --> 46:55.145
the Controlled Substances Act,

46:56.271 --> 46:57.648
attempted murder…

47:00.192 --> 47:01.151
and…

47:03.904 --> 47:07.950
and several violations
of the Punishment of Violences Act.

47:14.873 --> 47:16.333
As of this moment,

47:17.084 --> 47:19.378
you are expelled from Jinwon High School.

47:21.755 --> 47:24.591
You will never
return to this school ever again.

47:29.346 --> 47:30.305
Take him away.

47:30.889 --> 47:33.225
The Bureau will proceed
according to protocol.

47:33.308 --> 47:34.393
[officers] Yes, sir.

47:36.937 --> 47:37.896
[music fades]

47:38.897 --> 47:40.232
[car door closes]

47:40.816 --> 47:41.650
Hm.

47:45.279 --> 47:46.113
Oh!

47:47.114 --> 47:48.824
[Gang-seok] Hey, what happened?

47:49.533 --> 47:50.367
Huh?

47:51.076 --> 47:52.494
-You got stabbed?
-Yeah, I'm fine.

47:52.578 --> 47:54.037
-[Geun-dae] You okay?
-A few stitches.

47:54.121 --> 47:56.123
-Cho Gyu-cheol, you bastard! You did this?
-Stop him!

47:56.206 --> 47:57.249
-You son of a…
-Whoa!

47:57.332 --> 47:59.251
-He's my son-in-law! Come out!
-Stop!

47:59.334 --> 48:01.086
-[Gang-seok] You little shit!
-[Han-rim] Stop!

48:01.169 --> 48:03.380
-You stabbed my son-in-law?
-Go, go, go!

48:03.463 --> 48:05.966
-[Gang-seok] Come out of there!
-You've got to let him go!

48:06.049 --> 48:08.594
-I'll get you, you punk! Hey!
-Whoa, whoa!

48:08.677 --> 48:11.096
-[yells] You're killing me!
-[Han-rim groans]

48:11.179 --> 48:12.055
Minister!

48:12.139 --> 48:13.557
-[Hwa-jin groans]
-He's okay.

48:13.640 --> 48:14.850
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

48:14.933 --> 48:16.518
[Gang-seok] My fellow citizens,

48:16.602 --> 48:19.187
do you know the meaning of education?

48:19.897 --> 48:23.567
"The teaching of knowledge, skills,
and the cultivation of character."

48:24.067 --> 48:26.069
That is what a true education is.

48:26.862 --> 48:29.907
Good universities and good jobs
are important,

48:29.990 --> 48:31.491
but what is more essential

48:31.575 --> 48:35.579
is nurturing a person's integrity
and their moral compass as well.

48:36.079 --> 48:40.042
That is the kind of education
we need to strive for.

48:41.460 --> 48:43.128
And yet, today,

48:43.211 --> 48:46.840
Korea's education system
has strayed far from that purpose,

48:46.924 --> 48:48.467
and is broken.

48:48.550 --> 48:49.885
[poignant music plays]

48:50.886 --> 48:53.639
Nonetheless, in the midst of all this,

48:54.348 --> 48:57.809
most teachers in our country
continue to excel at their jobs.

48:57.893 --> 49:01.688
They keep teaching our children and strive
to guide them on the right path.

49:10.906 --> 49:13.575
How much longer do we have to see

49:14.201 --> 49:15.619
our students

49:16.244 --> 49:19.581
and our incredible teachers
go off to their schools

49:20.666 --> 49:22.334
and never make it back home?

49:24.836 --> 49:26.505
Until schools are no longer

49:27.005 --> 49:28.632
places of fear

49:29.299 --> 49:30.634
and anxiety…

49:32.678 --> 49:33.971
this Bureau

49:34.805 --> 49:37.766
will uphold the value of education,
and protect victims.

49:37.849 --> 49:41.937
Until Korea's education system
is restored to what it once was…

49:44.106 --> 49:45.482
we will be here.

49:56.535 --> 50:01.289
I MISS YOUR SMILE SO MUCH

50:09.297 --> 50:11.633
[Gang-seok] Good for you, Ga-yun, honey.

50:13.427 --> 50:15.804
There's so many people
who remember you dearly.

50:18.432 --> 50:20.767
THE LATE CHOI GA-YUN

50:23.353 --> 50:24.187
You need this?

50:27.232 --> 50:29.359
Hey, I'm not a crying man.

50:29.985 --> 50:32.279
I'm a man without tears. [chuckles]

50:32.362 --> 50:34.656
-I heard you've shed a lot of tears.
-[Gang-seok chuckles]

50:35.323 --> 50:37.993
-Who told you that?
-Ga-yun did.

50:38.827 --> 50:40.328
Ha! You're joking.

50:40.412 --> 50:41.872
She told me that, uh,

50:41.955 --> 50:45.751
you cried the day that the stray cat
you were taking care of got adopted.

50:46.585 --> 50:48.378
-She said you wept for a month.
-That's not…

50:48.462 --> 50:49.379
Oh!

50:49.963 --> 50:51.715
That's actually kinda sweet.

50:51.798 --> 50:54.718
He's very sweet. He's got
a lot of love in him. And many tears.

50:54.801 --> 50:57.304
-That's adorable, sir.
-I can't believe you.

50:57.387 --> 50:58.346
Hey, listen.

50:58.889 --> 51:01.016
Did you finish that report on Jinwon High?

51:01.099 --> 51:02.517
I want that report now!

51:02.601 --> 51:05.103
-He just turned into our boss, again.
-Is that even okay?

51:05.187 --> 51:06.563
[Hwa-jin] Workplace harassment.

51:06.646 --> 51:09.066
Harassment, my ass.
If you don't wanna work, just say so.

51:09.149 --> 51:11.401
But if you've got a beef,
we can settle this another way.

51:11.485 --> 51:13.653
[Geun-dae] Let me check
and get back to you. Bye.

51:13.737 --> 51:16.907
Listen up. We've got a lot of work
to do and not much time.

51:17.491 --> 51:19.326
I can't be the only working.

51:19.409 --> 51:21.244
Uh, Minister, fists down, please.

51:21.787 --> 51:24.164
-Let's get going. Come on, Inspector Im.
-[Han-rim] All right.

51:24.247 --> 51:25.082
[Geun-dae] Come on.

51:25.582 --> 51:28.043
-[Gang-seok] He's really scaring me.
-[Hwa-jin] Same here.

51:28.126 --> 51:31.004
Every time he sees me,
he asks for a report. It's tiring.

51:31.088 --> 51:32.714
He acts like he's the boss.

51:32.798 --> 51:34.841
Have you sent in the Jinwon High report?

51:34.925 --> 51:36.885
I'll do it today, if that's okay?

51:37.427 --> 51:39.137
Don't just stand there. Come on!

51:39.221 --> 51:40.722
-We're coming.
-Yeah, okay.

51:40.806 --> 51:45.102
And, Minister, you can't raise your fists
to an employee like that, ever, okay?

51:45.185 --> 51:46.269
[chuckles]

51:47.020 --> 51:47.896
Oh, watch.

51:47.979 --> 51:48.897
Yeah.

51:49.564 --> 51:50.440
-[yelps]
-Oh!

51:50.941 --> 51:52.025
What's wrong? What?

51:52.109 --> 51:53.693
-You held my hand.
-[Geun-dae] Oh.

51:54.528 --> 51:57.739
Well, there was a rock there
and I thought you might fall.

51:57.823 --> 51:59.825
Still, why would you do that?

51:59.908 --> 52:01.284
You held mine last time.

52:01.368 --> 52:02.536
No, I didn't. No.

52:02.619 --> 52:04.538
Jeez, I let you hold my hand
and I get told off.

52:04.621 --> 52:05.831
-You let me?
-What?

52:05.914 --> 52:07.582
-You "let me" hold it?
-What's going on?

52:07.666 --> 52:11.253
-[Han-rim] Why did you say it like that?
-They really like each other.

52:11.753 --> 52:13.630
But they don't seem to know it yet.

52:14.339 --> 52:15.924
Ah!

52:16.967 --> 52:18.718
[Han-rim] I need to sober up.
Please help me!

52:18.802 --> 52:20.345
-[Geun-dae] What should I do?
-Help me!

52:20.428 --> 52:22.347
-Like what?
-[Han-rim] I don't know. Something.

52:22.430 --> 52:24.933
-Just please do something!
-[Geun-dae] But what?

52:25.016 --> 52:27.102
Hold on. Just a second! Sorry!

52:29.396 --> 52:34.317
♪ From the day I found you ♪

52:36.945 --> 52:38.572
[Han-rim] Still, why hold my hand?

52:38.655 --> 52:41.158
-Well, I did let you--
-[Han-rim] Again with the "let me."

52:43.160 --> 52:45.579
[Geun-dae] Guys, hurry up.
You're lagging behind.

52:45.662 --> 52:47.998
-[Gang-seok] All right.
-[Hwa-jin] Keep your shirt on.

52:48.081 --> 52:50.333
-Should we hold hands too?
-[Gang-seok] What? No way!

52:50.417 --> 52:52.794
[Hwa-jin] Why are you getting flustered?
Feeling a bit lonely?

52:53.295 --> 52:56.256
-[Geun-dae] Stop chatting. Get a move on!
-[Hwa-jin] We're coming!

52:56.339 --> 52:57.257
[music fades]

52:57.340 --> 52:58.175
[thwacking]

52:58.258 --> 53:00.135
ASIAN GAMES BASKETBALL
SEO TAE-HUN WINS GOLD

53:05.849 --> 53:06.683
Next.

53:11.313 --> 53:12.606
Next!

53:14.232 --> 53:15.942
Move quicker, you asshole.

53:16.818 --> 53:19.362
Ugh, you fucking idiots.

53:19.863 --> 53:22.199
You guys get all the perks
because of me, huh?

53:23.783 --> 53:25.285
Right, you little fucker?

53:25.785 --> 53:26.620
Yeah.

53:26.703 --> 53:29.789
You're all going to Hanguk University
'cause I got scouted.

53:29.873 --> 53:32.500
Like a fucking
two-for-the-price-of-one deal, huh?

53:33.001 --> 53:34.878
And you fuckers don't even pay me back?

53:34.961 --> 53:38.298
If I'm not making real money in the pros,
you should make up for that.

53:39.883 --> 53:40.717
[sighs]

53:41.718 --> 53:42.802
Whatever.

53:43.470 --> 53:44.930
If you don't have the money,

53:45.013 --> 53:46.681
then you're gonna pay this way.

53:48.642 --> 53:49.476
Yeah.

53:50.727 --> 53:51.978
[Geun-dae] Stop!

53:56.942 --> 53:58.735
[rock music plays]

54:06.451 --> 54:09.704
You boys are all high school students.
You should be studying.

54:10.997 --> 54:13.250
Hey, guys. Get up.

54:13.833 --> 54:16.544
I said get up. It's okay. Don't worry.

54:17.045 --> 54:18.129
Come on. Up.

54:18.964 --> 54:22.008
I'm Deputy Director Bong Geun-dae
of the ERPB.

54:22.092 --> 54:23.385
And, right now,

54:24.094 --> 54:25.762
the ERPB

54:27.097 --> 54:28.598
is going to teach you a lesson.

54:31.309 --> 54:32.143
Come on, guys.

54:32.727 --> 54:33.728
Stand up.

54:33.812 --> 54:35.272
You can get back in line.

54:36.731 --> 54:37.732
Stand up.

54:37.816 --> 54:39.442
I said stand.

54:42.320 --> 54:44.322
[tense music plays]

54:45.657 --> 54:46.491
Yeah?

54:50.412 --> 54:52.038
-Hey, you told me to stand.
-Hey!

54:52.122 --> 54:53.873
Let go! I said let go.

54:53.957 --> 54:56.167
-You said stand up.
-I said let go.

54:56.251 --> 54:57.752
-[boy] No, stand up.
-[Geun-dae] Let go.

54:57.836 --> 54:59.379
-You told me to stand.
-Let go.

54:59.462 --> 55:01.881
Take your hands off him right now!

55:02.966 --> 55:03.800
Who's that?

55:04.426 --> 55:06.636
-[boys gasp]
-Stand up.

55:06.720 --> 55:08.054
[boys mutter]

55:08.138 --> 55:09.306
I said stand!

55:09.389 --> 55:10.390
♪ And listen, and learn… ♪

55:10.473 --> 55:13.184
If you listen to what we say,
we teach with words.

55:13.268 --> 55:17.188
And if a heavy hand is all that you need,
you'll have to learn the hard way.

55:17.272 --> 55:19.607
♪ Listen, and learn
And listen, and learn ♪

55:19.691 --> 55:21.276
♪ And listen, and learn ♪

55:22.736 --> 55:23.945
[Han-rim grunts]

55:24.029 --> 55:25.613
[both groan]

55:25.697 --> 55:27.741
-[Geun-dae] You okay?
-[Han-rim] I'm fine. You okay?

55:27.824 --> 55:29.367
-[Geun-dae] You're sure?
-Piece of shit.

55:29.451 --> 55:31.911
[Geun-dae] Whoa! Don't!
Stop, come on, don't!

55:31.995 --> 55:33.246
You think this is funny?

55:33.330 --> 55:35.415
-[Geun-dae] You'll get hurt!
-[Han-rim] No, I won't!

55:35.498 --> 55:38.835
Well, well, well, well.
Would you look at this sorry bunch?

55:38.918 --> 55:42.088
You're athletes, but you're putting up
with this crap instead of training.

55:42.797 --> 55:45.425
Even with the Bureau here,
you still don't know how to behave?

55:46.259 --> 55:47.135
Huh?

55:47.218 --> 55:48.303
[rock music plays]

55:48.970 --> 55:49.804
Well?

55:52.640 --> 55:55.977
Students have no authority
in school whatsoever.

55:56.061 --> 55:58.646
Not even athletes
representing the country.

55:59.272 --> 56:01.107
You may or may not know this,

56:01.191 --> 56:04.319
but the newly-revived ERPB
has no limits on our

56:04.903 --> 56:06.738
education methods.

56:07.322 --> 56:09.449
So from this moment on…

56:11.618 --> 56:13.036
I'll be teaching you a lesson.

56:13.119 --> 56:15.955
♪ Chihuahua, chihuahua ♪

56:16.581 --> 56:19.292
♪ Chihuahua, chihuahua ♪

56:19.793 --> 56:20.919
♪ Chihuahua… ♪

56:30.428 --> 56:33.223
TEACH YOU A LESSON

56:34.099 --> 56:36.851
♪ You say we are small
So you think we are weak ♪

56:36.935 --> 56:40.313
♪ Well, you might be right
But we are ready to fight ♪

56:40.397 --> 56:43.233
♪ We've got brains
Also, we are fearless ♪

56:43.316 --> 56:46.653
♪ Don't mess with us
Or you are dead meat ♪

56:46.736 --> 56:49.906
♪ We look pretty cute
But don't judge us by that ♪

56:49.989 --> 56:53.076
♪ We bark like thunder
And we move like wind ♪

56:53.159 --> 56:56.287
♪ Did you say we're small?
Do you still think we are weak? ♪

56:57.330 --> 56:58.331
All right.

56:59.624 --> 57:01.209
♪ Chihuahua… ♪

57:01.292 --> 57:03.461
You think it's all over for me?

57:03.545 --> 57:04.838
[groans]

57:04.921 --> 57:07.590
-[woman] Mr. Hwang!
-[Gi-tae groans]

57:07.674 --> 57:10.135
-[officer 1] Let's get him up.
-[officer 2] Come on.

57:10.218 --> 57:11.594
[Gi-tae groans]

57:11.678 --> 57:14.597
I'll… be back, I'm warning you.

57:15.098 --> 57:16.516
You'll be the first I bring down.

57:17.392 --> 57:21.396
♪ We are small, chihuahua, chihuahua… ♪

57:21.479 --> 57:23.940
You knew what really happened
when Cho Gyu-cheol

57:24.899 --> 57:26.359
gave you the recording.

57:27.068 --> 57:29.028
You should have stopped it then.

57:29.529 --> 57:30.947
It's people like you

57:31.531 --> 57:34.033
who turn young students into monsters.

57:34.117 --> 57:37.537
You might not be capable of being good,
but you should've known better.

57:38.163 --> 57:40.331
What about you?
You think you're so righteous?

57:40.832 --> 57:43.543
I'm sure there are skeletons
in your closet! Huh?

57:43.626 --> 57:44.627
[music fades]

57:45.628 --> 57:47.297
[sniffs]

57:47.797 --> 57:48.756
[sniffs]

57:50.717 --> 57:52.719
[rock music plays]

57:54.137 --> 57:56.264
[Gang-seok] Hmm.

57:57.849 --> 57:59.100
And so,

58:00.018 --> 58:01.436
I'm not really

58:01.936 --> 58:03.188
a good person either.

58:04.898 --> 58:07.066
-[Gang-seok grunts]
-[screams in pain]

58:07.150 --> 58:08.276
[Gi-tae groans]

58:08.359 --> 58:09.694
-Ow!
-[officer 3] What the…

58:09.777 --> 58:10.862
[Gi-tae groans]

58:10.945 --> 58:12.864
-Oh.
-Oh my goodness! Did you see that?

58:12.947 --> 58:14.115
[laughs]

58:16.493 --> 58:19.579
♪ Chihuahua, chihuahua ♪

58:19.662 --> 58:21.080
♪ Chihuahua ♪

58:21.164 --> 58:22.790
♪ We are cute ♪

58:22.874 --> 58:26.127
♪ Chihuahua, chihuahua ♪

58:26.211 --> 58:27.629
♪ Chihuahua ♪

58:27.712 --> 58:29.214
♪ We are smart ♪

58:29.297 --> 58:32.133
♪ Chihuahua, chihuahua ♪

58:32.217 --> 58:34.135
♪ Chihuahua ♪

58:34.219 --> 58:35.637
♪ We are small ♪

58:35.720 --> 58:38.848
♪ Chihuahua, chihuahua ♪

58:38.932 --> 58:40.141
♪ Chihuahua ♪

58:40.225 --> 58:42.143
♪ But we are strong ♪

59:27.772 --> 59:28.690
[music fades]
